{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB新劇《死有對証》首支宣傳片驚爆吳若希（Jinny）將會慘死，劇情極具衝擊性！Jinny本人更在社交網高EQ轉發，笑言「可以趕得切喺農曆七月之前死畀大家睇」，百無禁忌的態度引發熱議。有網民大膽追問瞓解剖床的感受，Jinny的爆笑回應更成為焦點，究竟她首次演死屍有何難忘經歷？</p><p>吳若希高EQ宣傳新劇 百無禁忌自嘲七月前死</p><p>新劇《死有對証》宣傳片揭示吳若希飾演的單佩嘉將會慘死，其後更要由好友程芷昕（陳曉華飾）親手解剖。宣傳片一出即引來極大迴響，而吳若希本人亦在社交網站轉載，並以極高EQ宣傳，她留言道：「可以趕得切喺農曆七月之前死畀大家睇。三年前我哋都係農曆七月拍㗎！」如此玩得的宣傳方式，引來不少網民大讚好笑。更有網民直接在留言區問Jinny躺在解剖床上是否很冷，她竟親自爆笑回覆：「好乸凍！」率直的回應讓網民對劇集更加期待。</p><p>首演死屍自責唔稱職 吳若希爆因一事忍唔住喊</p><p>對於這次衝擊性的演出，吳若希受訪時坦言是首次正式飾演死屍及躺在解剖床上，過程非常緊張，她更搞笑地自責表現不佳。原來，在拍攝被閨密陳曉華解剖的一幕時，她完全感受到對方戲內戲外的姊妹情，她憶述：「當日拍嗰陣 Feel 到佢喊時，我係超傷心嘅，有種好唔捨得嘅感覺。」結果，作為一具「死屍」的她，竟然也忍不住跟著流淚，讓她不禁自嘲：「所以我覺得我做得唔好，因為 as 死屍我喺度喊。」</p><p>網民激讚期待值爆燈：「好乸凍真係好笑！」</p><p>吳若希這次百無禁忌的宣傳手法和幕後趣聞分享，成功引起網民熱烈討論，輿論幾乎一面倒大讚。不少網民湧入其社交平台留言，表示非常期待劇集播出，有網民笑稱：「Jinny真係玩得，好期待你『死』！」、「個回應好真實，『好乸凍』真係笑咗出聲！」、「未開播已經咁爆，一定要追！」、「估唔到演死屍都咁多內心戲！」、「同陳曉華嘅姊妹情好似好真，期待！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/01_19994551296a98f31d315ce.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/04_7185036726a98f320b9f15.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/05_8554998246a98f3263f023.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/06a_12745664546a98f32bcc42b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/06_6645385036a98f33376203.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/07_17154139766a98f33875176.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/08_9967286986a98f33e9bacc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/09_665514696a98f345e2f78.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/10_11945366066a98f35634395.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/11_15223617046a98f3602e6b0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/12_7236326866a98f3687692e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14_20051300946a98f36d0cb31.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/15_17174182556a98f3709e4c2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/16a_1327820046a98f37763539.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/16_14761843226a98f386396db.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17_18185420696a98f38db1600.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/18_14939239456a98f3a0c179c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/19_20579540936a98f3a440949.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20_15293870026a98f3a8eb435.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/21_16379779006a98f3ad4e038.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/22_2169311226a98f3b06b1f4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/23_14345446906a98f3b3c3e8d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T04:24:02.046553+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1023,"images":22,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}